---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const email = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL;
const validEmail = typeof email==='string' && /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email);
---
<Base title="Contact | CalcSolver.info" description="Feedback and help for the CalcSolver calculator, math guides and activities."><div class="page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span> / </span><span>Contact</span></nav><h1>Contact & feedback</h1><p class="page-lead">Help make CalcSolver a little better.</p><div class="article-body">{validEmail ? <p>For questions, suggestions or a problem with the site, email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</p> : <p>A support contact address will be published here when it becomes available. In the meantime, the tips below can help you identify a problem.</p>}<h2>A calculation looks wrong?</h2><p>Check the expression for missing brackets or operators. Scientific functions use degrees. A percentage such as 25% means 0.25; multiplying a price by 25% gives the amount of the discount.</p><h2>An activity does not load?</h2><p>Use Reload or Open in new tab in the player. External providers can change or go offline. Select Server 2 to try the local games.</p><h2>Details that help</h2><p>If you report a problem, include the information below so it can be reproduced:</p><ul><li>The page or four-digit activity code.</li><li>Your device and browser.</li><li>The expression you entered or the steps you followed.</li><li>What you expected and what happened.</li></ul></div><div class="calculator-cta"><span>Learn how your information is used.</span><a href="/privacy/">Read the privacy policy →</a></div></div></Base>
